  "description": "Vanilla Aura is a warm and comforting gourmand fragrance centered around creamy vanilla sweetness with soft florals and smooth musky warmth. The scent feels cozy, feminine, and addictive while maintaining a refined and elegant balance. The opening introduces sweet creamy accords with soft fruity nuances, creating a warm and inviting first impression that immediately feels comforting. The heart develops into delicate florals and caramelized sweetness, adding richness and a soft feminine elegance to the composition. The base settles into vanilla, amber, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a creamy, warm, and long-lasting trail that feels smooth, cozy, and luxurious. Vanilla Aura is perfect for women who enjoy sweet vanilla fragrances with creamy gourmand warmth and a soft musky finish.",
